    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Les r&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s de ce projet comprennent : 1)  acqu&#xe9;rir des comp&#xe9;tences qui favorisent l&apos;employabilit&#xe9;, y compris le d&#xe9;veloppement de savoir-faire (comp&#xe9;tences ou t&#xe2;ches sp&#xe9;cifiques li&#xe9;es &#xe0; une profession), de savoir-&#xea;tre (comme les comp&#xe9;tences interpersonnelles) et de connaissances (l&apos;apprentissage d&apos;une langue, par exemple); 2) faire progresser chaque stagiaire en termes de sensibilisation, de mobilisation et d&apos;engagement en faveur du d&#xe9;veloppement international.gr&#xe2;ce &#xe0; son exp&#xe9;rience de stage et aux activit&#xe9;s d&apos;engagement innovantes propos&#xe9;es.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcomes of this project include: (1) acquired skills that promote employability, including the development of know-how (specific skills or tasks related to a profession), soft skills (such as interpersonal skills), and knowledge (learning a language, for example); and (2) enhanced growth of each intern in terms of awareness, mobilization, and engagement in favor of international development through their internship experience and innovative engagement activities proposed,</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
